---
source: src/lib.rs
expression: "rendered.join(\"\\n\\n\")"
---
--- "meta A = {x Int}\nmeta A = {y Int}"
DuplicateMeta: Duplicate meta: A

--- "meta A = {}\nmeta B = {}\n@main\na = A {}\n@main\nb = B {}"
MultipleMain: Multiple @main annotations

--- "meta A = Unknown"
UnknownType: Unknown type: Unknown

--- "meta A = &Unknown"
UnknownMetaInReference: Unknown meta in reference: Unknown

--- "meta A = B\nmeta B = A"
CyclicReference: Cyclic reference: B -> A

--- "meta Foo = {x Int}\nfoo = Foo {x String}"
TypeMismatch: Type mismatch: expected Int, got String

--- "meta Foo = {x Concrete<Int>}\nfoo = Foo {x Int}"
ConcreteRequiresLiteral: Concrete<Int> requires a literal value, got type reference Int

--- "meta Foo = {x \"a\"}\nfoo = Foo {x \"b\"}"
LiteralMismatch: Literal mismatch: expected "a", got "b"

--- "meta Foo = {x String}\nfoo = Foo {x \"lit\"}"
LiteralForOpenType: Cannot use literal for open String type - use Concrete<String>

--- "meta Foo = {x Int}\nfoo = Foo {x Int, y Int}"
ExtraField: Extra field not in schema: y

--- "meta Foo = {x! Int}\nfoo = Foo {}"
MissingRequiredField: Missing required field: x

--- "meta Foo = {x Int}\nfoo = Foo {x Int, x Int}"
DuplicateField: Duplicate field: x

--- "meta Status = Pending | Active\nmeta P = {s! Status}\np = P {s \"other\"}"
UnionMismatch: Value doesn't match any union variant

--- "meta I = {x Int}\nmeta F = {items [3]I}\ni = I {x Int}\nf = F {items [i]}"
ListCardinalityMismatch: List cardinality mismatch: got 1 elements, expected Exact(3)

--- "meta E = {...}\nmeta C = {emits []E}\ne = E {id String}\nc = C {emits [e & {id \"x\"}]}"
NotRefinable: Cannot use concrete value for open type field 'id' - type is not refinable (use -E)

--- "meta E = {id String}\nmeta C = {fields {...}\n@source [fields]\nemits E}\nc = C {fields {a Int}\nemits {id String = other.id}}"
SourcePathNotAllowed: Source path 'other.id' not allowed by @source

--- "meta E = {id String}\nmeta C = {fields {...}\n@source [fields]\nemits E}\nother = E {id String}\nc = C {fields {x Int}\nemits other}"
NoSourceFound: No source found for field 'id'

--- "meta Foo = {\n@constraint x > 10\nx Int\n}\nfoo = Foo {x 5}"
LiteralForOpenType: Cannot use literal for open Int type - use Concrete<Int>
ConstraintFailed: Constraint failed for instance 'foo'
  where:
    5 > 10 = false

--- "meta Foo = {\n@constraint y > 0\nx Int\n}\nfoo = Foo {x 1}"
LiteralForOpenType: Cannot use literal for open Int type - use Concrete<Int>
ConstraintEvalError: Constraint evaluation error: Unknown variable: y
